{"id":"cabinet:gem+gemr","view34":"PASS","quality":"PASS","reason":"Top wood plane is a readable 3px lit surface above the front lip, and the crystal clusters and cut gems have clean 4-tone facet ramps with material-colored outlines."}
{"id":"cabinet:bolt+boltg+boltr","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"The blue cloth corner on the top shelf hangs straight across the wooden shelf plank into the middle bay's red stack, and the 1px-stripe stacks read like burgers/mushrooms rather than folded fabric bolts."}
{"id":"cabinet:bottle+bottler+bottley","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"The wine bottles use a full-width 4px white label band (eeeE) with no side outlines that cuts the bottle silhouettes in half, and the middle-right green jug lacks a neck and reads as a flat 4x3 block."}
{"id":"cabinet:candle","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"The pillar candles place a back-wall-colored wick pixel inside the top rim (oLkLo), carving a dark U-shaped notch into each candle top so they read as hollow cups or tunics, while the tapers lack side outlines."}
{"id":"cabinet:cheese","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"The small right-hand wedges (wedge4) are 4x4 blobs dominated by 10 dark outline pixels around only 3 interior pixels, and the cut wheels look like rounded lumps with a vertical 2px white tag on the right edge."}
